      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i woke up feeling really rough. my throat is super sore and i have a fever of like 101. i have some amoxicillin left over from a sinus infection i had a few months ago... do u think i should just start taking those now to get ahead of it so it doesn't get worse? maybe 500mg twice a day?",
